原型污染是一种安全漏洞，攻击者将属性注入到 Object.prototype 中，从而影响应用程序中的所有对象。

     **易受攻击的代码：**```javascript
     function merge(target, source) {
       for (let key in source) {
         target[key] = source[key];
       }
       return target;
     }

     // Attack payload
     const malicious = JSON.parse('{"__proto__": {"polluted": "yes"}}');
     merge({}, malicious);

     console.log({}.polluted); // "yes" - all objects are polluted!
     ```**预防1：使用Object.create(null):**```javascript
     // Create objects without prototype
     const safeObj = Object.create(null);
     safeObj.__proto__ = { polluted: 'yes' };
     console.log(safeObj.polluted); // undefined

     // For configuration objects
     const config = Object.create(null);
     config.apiUrl = 'https://api.example.com';
     ``` …

